Z||000005||Jaei Sun||02-06-2001||11:17 PM||||The stuff I used was meant for vinyl/plastic coloring in cars.  It's called SEM Colorcoat. Preped it right and no problems with peeling/cracking/rubbing off... none at all.  I clean the white with 409 and it works fantastic.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://members.aol.com/umebottle3/fie_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
